# Generated analysis artifacts.
#
# Policy: the offline-renderer binary is reproducible from source and stays
# out of the repo. BUT analysis/plugin_outputs/ and analysis/results/ are
# intentionally tracked — ARCHITECTURE.md and CLAUDE.md treat per-version
# renders and scored reports as the project's score history, and cross-
# version comparison depends on them. Keep adding new plugin_outputs/<algo>_vN/
# and results/<algo>_vN/ directories to the repo; do NOT add those paths here.
# Curated reference fixtures under analysis/test_files/ are also tracked.
analysis/variphrase_render
analysis/*_comparison.png
analysis/tmp/
analysis/.cache/

# Scratch / local output
tmp/
scratch/
*.log
